<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-David Jones falls as profits slashed.</title>
<headline>RTRS-David Jones falls as profits slashed.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in David Jones Ltd dived sharply after the upmarket department store operator said earlier on Friday it had lowered its first half net profit forecast by up to 50 percent due to lower revenues and higher depreciation charges.</p>
<p>From A$1.77 prior to the announcement, the shares dived nine cents to an intra-day low of A$1.68.</p>
</text>
